企业英文简介:
CloudEngine Digital is a global AI data center and GPU computing infrastructure service provider headquartered in Singapore. It has been deeply involved in the entire chain of AI computing infrastructure services and operates 12 wholly-owned subsidiaries worldwide. 
Covering multiple countries such as Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, Vietnam, Saudi Arabia, the United States, Japan and South Korea, the core services include: 
1. ROCE and IB networking solutions, layout diagram design, P2P connection table design, cable length estimation;
2. Installation and deployment of GPU servers/switches, debugging and optimization;
3. Comprehensive wiring in the machine room, route planning and testing;
4. Infrastructure projects such as cabinets, racks, PDUs, cold and hot aisles, liquid cooling, etc.;
5. Equipment maintenance, on-site personnel presence, spare parts storage and cross-border logistics services. 
